## Excerpt for /etc/wazuh-indexer/jvm.options on wazuh-server.
##
## The indexer (OpenSearch) defaults to a heap far larger than a 4 GB VM can afford next to
## the manager and the dashboard. 1 GB is enough for two or three agents in a lab.
## Keep Xms and Xmx equal, then: sudo systemctl restart wazuh-indexer
-Xms1g
-Xmx1g
